<title>CHINA: Banque Paribas gets approval for Shanghai branch.</title>
<headline>Banque Paribas gets approval for Shanghai branch.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Banque Paribas has received permission to open a full branch office in Shanghai and expects to begin foreign currency operations in March, a bank official in Shanghai said on Monday.</p>
<p>The bank has become the 46th foreign financial institution to be granted full branch status in Shanghai, China's financial centre.</p>
</text>
